+      },
+      {
+        "id": "C25-N02",
+        "check": "A security profile saved inactive: reviewing a New security profile draft with \"active\": false shows the impact 'Saves this profile inactive. The service does not list inactive profiles, so it will not appear in the profile list or read back after saving; note its name and ID first.' (an active draft shows the ordinary 'Applies only to this tenant' impact)."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "C25-N03",
+        "check": "Academy device sign-in when desktop.me names the account by a UUID (as live Academy does): after approval the Academy account group says 'Signed in to Academy as' with the display name, and the learner is kept across a relaunch."
+      },
+      {
+        "id": "C25-N04",
